rain
// Regions: nested, captioned, brackets down the right of the grid
(Doc)-[edit(Doc)]->(Alice)            : The Doc grants Alice Edit
(Alice)-[edit(Doc)]->(Bob)            : Alice passes Edit to Bob
>>> A: Bob does stuff
(Bob)=[[edit]]=>(Doc)                 : Bob edits the Doc
>>> B: Carol joins in
bob-carol: (Bob)-[read(Doc)]->(Carol) : Bob gives Carol Read
(Carol)=[[read]]=>(Doc)               : Carol reads the Doc
<<< B
<<< A
(Alice)-<revoke>-x[bob-carol]         : Alice cuts Carol off
